 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px" ALIGN="center"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">SUBSCRIPTION AGREEMENT </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT
SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Subscription Agreement, dated as of September [&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;], 2004, between Salomon Brothers Variable Rate
Strategic Fund Inc., a corporation organized under the laws of Maryland (the &#147;Fund&#148;) and Citigroup Financial Products Inc. (the &#147;Purchaser&#148;). </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT
SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">WHEREAS, the Fund is an investment company registered under the Investment Company Act of 1940, as amended (the &#147;1940
